{"id":"6965d045e3a44cd2","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-function-closure.md","title":"Closure under Finitary Function Operators","display":"df-function-closure — Closure under Finitary Function Operators","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-function-closure","aliases":["57-df-function-closure"],"display":"df-function-closure — Closure under Finitary Function Operators","depends_on":["[[57-df-natural-number]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-function-closure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-function-closure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-function-closure — Closure under Finitary Function Operators"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"aa2f7d42f23bb3d7\" href=\"?note=aa2f7d42f23bb3d7\" title=\"57-df-natural-number\">57-df-natural-number</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq F\">\\(B\\subseteq F\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O\\subseteq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\{O:O:F^k\\to F\\}\">\\(\\mathcal O\\subseteq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\{O:O:F^k\\to F\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 是本调用的固定环境参数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Closure}\">\\(\\mathrm{Closure}\\)</span> 的两个公开参数仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,\\mathcal O\">\\(B,\\mathcal O\\)</span>。自然数递归取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"aa2f7d42f23bb3d7\" href=\"?note=aa2f7d42f23bb3d7\" title=\"57-df-natural-number\">57-df-natural-number</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r,k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(r,k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O[X^k]=\\{O(\\vec a):\\vec a\\in X^k\\}\">\\(O[X^k]=\\{O(\\vec a):\\vec a\\in X^k\\}\\)</span> 是函数像。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C_0(B,\\mathcal O)\\coloneqq B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C_0(B,\\mathcal O)\\coloneqq B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C_{r+1}(B,\\mathcal O)\\coloneqq C_r(B,\\mathcal O)\\cup\n\\{O(\\vec a):k\\in\\mathbb N\\land O\\in\\mathcal O\\land O:F^k\\to F\\land\\vec a\\in C_r(B,\\mathcal O)^k\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C_{r+1}(B,\\mathcal O)\\coloneqq C_r(B,\\mathcal O)\\cup\n\\{O(\\vec a):k\\in\\mathbb N\\land O\\in\\mathcal O\\land O:F^k\\to F\\land\\vec a\\in C_r(B,\\mathcal O)^k\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Closure}(B,\\mathcal O)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{r\\in\\mathbb N}C_r(B,\\mathcal O).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Closure}(B,\\mathcal O)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{r\\in\\mathbb N}C_r(B,\\mathcal O).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Closure}(B,\\mathcal O)=\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq F:B\\subseteq X\\land\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall O\\in\\mathcal O\\;((O:F^k\\to F)\\to O[X^k]\\subseteq X)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Closure}(B,\\mathcal O)=\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq F:B\\subseteq X\\land\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall O\\in\\mathcal O\\;((O:F^k\\to F)\\to O[X^k]\\subseteq X)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这里闭包的是函数对象集合。它不同于 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e8de756444081284\" href=\"?note=e8de756444081284\" title=\"57-df-closure-operator\">57-df-closure-operator</a> 的结构载体生成闭包；后者的文件、对象和调用名均未更改。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-natural-number","status":"resolved","id":"aa2f7d42f23bb3d7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-natural-number]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-natural-number","status":"resolved","id":"aa2f7d42f23bb3d7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$F$ 为集合，$B\\subseteq F$，$\\mathcal O\\subseteq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\{O:O:F^k\\to F\\}$。$F$ 是本调用的固定环境参数；$\\mathrm{Closure}$ 的两个公开参数仍为 $B,\\mathcal O$。自然数递归取 [[57-df-natural-number]]。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-closure-operator","status":"resolved","id":"e8de756444081284","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"这里闭包的是函数对象集合。它不同于 [[57-df-closure-operator]] 的结构载体生成闭包；后者的文件、对象和调用名均未更改。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"B\\subseteq F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal O\\subseteq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\{O:O:F^k\\to F\\}","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Closure}","display":false},{"tex":"B,\\mathcal O","display":false},{"tex":"r,k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"O[X^k]=\\{O(\\vec a):\\vec a\\in X^k\\}","display":false},{"tex":"C_0(B,\\mathcal O)\\coloneqq B.","display":true},{"tex":"C_{r+1}(B,\\mathcal O)\\coloneqq C_r(B,\\mathcal O)\\cup\n\\{O(\\vec a):k\\in\\mathbb N\\land O\\in\\mathcal O\\land O:F^k\\to F\\land\\vec a\\in C_r(B,\\mathcal O)^k\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Closure}(B,\\mathcal O)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{r\\in\\mathbb N}C_r(B,\\mathcal O).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Closure}(B,\\mathcal O)=\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq F:B\\subseteq X\\land\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall O\\in\\mathcal O\\;((O:F^k\\to F)\\to O[X^k]\\subseteq X)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1283,"backlinks":[{"id":"6198f000bea16af4","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$Z,S,\\pi_i^n$ 取 [[57-df-zero-function]]、[[57-df-successor-function]]、[[57-df-projection-function]]；$Z$ 仍为一元零函数。$D_n,\\mathcal F_n,\\mathrm{Comp}$ 取 [[57-df-composition-operator]]；$\\mathrm{PrimRec}$ 取 [[57-df-primrec-operator]]。固定 $F=\\bigcup_{n\\ge1}\\mathcal F_n$ 作为 [[57-df-function-closure]] 的闭包论域。$m\\ge1$，$g,h,f_1,\\ldots,f_m\\in F$；$f\\in F$。$C_m:F^{m+1}\\to F$ 和 $R:F^2\\to F$ 在下式定义；类型不相容时返回同一个 $Z$。"},{"id":"672b43fc6a891c3a","anchor":"ref-125","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-addition-function]]\n[[57-df-composition-operator]]\n[[57-df-divrem-function]]\n[[57-df-effective-procedure]]\n[[57-df-encoding]]\n[[57-df-factorial-function]]\n[[57-df-function-closure]]\n[[57-df-halt-notation]]\n[[57-df-machine-coding]]\n[[57-df-min-operator-generalized]]\n[[57-df-multiplication-function]]\n[[57-df-normal-form-theorem]]\n[[57-df-primrec-operator]]\n[[57-df-program-numbering]]\n[[57-df-projection-function]]\n[[57-df-recursive-function-class]]\n[[57-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate]]\n[[57-df-sequence-concatenation]]\n[[57-df-successor-function]]\n[[57-df-t-predicate]]\n[[57-df-turing-machine]]\n[[57-df-zero-function]]"},{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-221","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-addition-function]]\n[[57-df-composition-operator]]\n[[57-df-divrem-function]]\n[[57-df-effective-procedure]]\n[[57-df-encoding]]\n[[57-df-factorial-function]]\n[[57-df-function-closure]]\n[[57-df-halt-notation]]\n[[57-df-machine-coding]]\n[[57-df-min-operator-generalized]]\n[[57-df-multiplication-function]]\n[[57-df-normal-form-theorem]]\n[[57-df-primrec-oper